{"id":"wb-5-288","name":"水绘园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"水绘园","text":"水绘园位于中国江苏省南通市如皋市碧霞路299号，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n始建于明万历年间，为冒氏所有，明末清初冒襄即居于此，后渐衰败。乾隆时汪之珩在此建水明楼，形成现有格局。水明楼为一画舫式建筑，建于洗钵池旁，二层，楼上为客座、暖阁。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E7%BB%98%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":92116170,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92116170","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b7761c61254692aba2c1b28b.jpg","title":"水绘园.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B0%B4%E7%BB%98%E5%9B%AD.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/%E6%B0%B4%E7%BB%98%E5%9B%AD.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Howhowforever","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​水绘园","width":320,"height":180}}